        <body>
            <div xml:id="d318">

                <pb facs="0571" n="477" sameAs="frus:frus1887/pg477"/>

                <head>No. 318.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bayard to Mr. Phelps</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1887-05-23"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 23,
                        1887</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 625.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I transmit herewith for your information
                    copies of recent correspondence relative to the case of the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Sarah H. Prior</hi>, one of the fishery cases.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">T. F. Bayard.</hi></signed></closer>




